---
// Retired into /pipeline.
//
// This page carried two things: the layers as a dated history, and a matrix of which papers
// had which. Both now live at /pipeline, where the graph is generated from
// pipeline/layers.yaml rather than written here, and each cell's state is computed from the
// run ledger rather than detected from a file's existence. The dated findings moved into the
// `found` field of each layer's declaration, so they sit beside the layer that produced them.
//
// Kept as a redirect because the URL was linked from the docs and from commit messages.
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/$/, '');
return Astro.redirect(`${base}/pipeline/`, 301);
---
